    "created_at": "2024-04-02T14:00:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-02T14:00:02Z",
    "body": "For what it's worth, [XPath 1.0's definition](https://www.w3.org/TR/xpath-10/#function-lang) was vague (\"ignoring case\") and the [definition in XPath 2.0](https://www.w3.org/TR/2010/REC-xpath-functions-20101214/#func-lang) and [the definition in XPath 3.1](https://www.w3.org/TR/xpath-functions-31/#func-lang) specify caseless default match.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
